@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About Us";
    ViewData["MetaDescription"] = "Our clients are politicians, businesspeople, and influencers – individuals who are not only successful in their careers but also represent the image of an entire group, organization, or nation. We understand that every time you appear before the public, the media, or partners, your image must project composure, dignity, and class.";
}

<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/swiper@11/swiper-bundle.min.css" />
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/swiper@11/swiper-bundle.min.js"></script>
<div class="luxury-banner position-relative">
    <picture>
        <source media="(min-width: 992px)"
                srcset="/image/banner-main-project.png">
        <source media="(min-width: 576px)"
                srcset="/image/banner-main-project.png">
        <img src="/image/banner-main-project.png"
             class="img-fluid w-100"
             alt="Bespoke Tailoring">
    </picture>
    <div class="position-absolute top-50 start-50 translate-middle text-center text-white px-3" style="width:100%;">
    </div>
</div>
<section class="our-story py-5">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row align-items-center">
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <div class="story-image overflow-hidden">
                    <img src="/image/imgtext_1_img.jpg" alt="Suit Detail" class="img-fluid w-75 mx-auto d-block">
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <span class="text-uppercase d-block mx-auto letter-spacing">
                    Our Story
                </span>
                <h1 class="mt-2 mb-4 text-dark">
                    UNLIM Tailor – Tailoring Class
                </h1>
                <p class="text-secondary lh-lg">
                    Since establishing the UNLIM Tailor brand, we have been committed to more than simply tailoring a suit; we aspire to create a refined presence for individuals who carry great responsibility.
                </p>

                <p class="text-secondary lh-lg">
                    Our clients include politicians and business leaders — individuals who represent not only themselves but entire organizations and nations. Every appearance must embody composure, dignity, and distinction.
                </p>

                <p class="text-secondary lh-lg">
                    Each suit is meticulously handcrafted and fully personalized. We operate in a private, discreet environment — because elegance and confidentiality are essential to the elite.
                </p>

                <p class="text-secondary lh-lg">
                    Fabrics are sourced from prestigious suppliers in Italy and England, ensuring that excellence begins from the very first touch.
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<section class="journey-section">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="journey-title pt-4 text-white">OUR JOURNEY</h2>
        <div class="timeline-container">
            <div class="timeline-item left">
                <div class="content row">
                    <h3 class="booking-btn">CONSULTATION AND SELECTION</h3>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="icon-box"><img src="/image/B1 (2).png" class="journey-image-next" alt="All images of us, the processes that we have established"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <p>Design consultation: the first chapter of personal identity</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="timeline-item right">
                <div class="content row">
                    <h3 class="booking-btn">TAKE MEASUREMENTS</h3>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="icon-box"><img src="/image/B2 (2).png" class="journey-image-next" alt="All images of us, the processes that we have established"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <p>
                            Elegant Style (Affirming Bespoke Excellence)<br />
                            Meticulous Tailoring: The Foundation for a Perfect Suit at UNLIM
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="timeline-item left">
                <div class="content row">
                    <h3 class="booking-btn">CUSTOM-MADE WESTERN CLOTHING</h3>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="icon-box"><img src="/image/B3.jpg" class="journey-image-next" alt="All images of us, the processes that we have established"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <p>
                            Selecting only the finest fabrics<br />
                            We have thousands of fabric samples for you to choose from.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="timeline-item right">
                <div class="content row">
                    <h3 class="booking-btn">FITTING AND EDITING</h3>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="icon-box"><img src="/image/B4.jpg" class="journey-image-next" alt="All images of us, the processes that we have established"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <p>
                            Defining the perfect fit in every design.<br />
                            Our most skilled tailors
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="timeline-item left">
                <div class="content row">
                    <h3 class="booking-btn">COMPLETION</h3>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="icon-box"><img src="/image/B5.png" class="journey-image-next"  alt="All images of us, the processes that we have established"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <p>A moment of pride and a promise to time.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<section class="pillars bg-body-secondary">
    <div>
        <h2 class="section-title">OUR PILLARS</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="pillars-grid">
        <div class="pillar-item">
            <div class="icon-container">
                <img src="/image/banmay.png" alt="PRECISION CRAFT" class="pillar-item-image-icon" />
            </div>
            <h4>1. PRECISION CRAFT</h4>
            <p>Tailoring built on dedication.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pillar-item">
            <div class="icon-container">
                <img src="/image/vector-kim.png" alt="MODERN FIT" class="pillar-item-image-icon" />
            </div>
            <h4>2. MODERN FIT</h4>
            <p>Designed for the way you move.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pillar-item">
            <div class="icon-container">
                <img src="/image/vector-day.png" alt="UNLIMITED CUSTOMIZATION" class="pillar-item-image-icon" />
            </div>
            <h4>3. UNLIMITED CUSTOMIZATION</h4>
            <p>Your vision, limitless choices.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<section class="craftsmanship-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header text-center mt-5">
            <h3 class="section-title">THE CRAFTSMANSHIP</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="craft-row">
            <div class="craft-image">
                <img src="/image/abus-vest.png" alt="abus-vest.png">
            </div>
            <div class="craft-content">
                <h5 class="text-uppercase">The identity of the wearer's style and personality.</h5>
                <p>
                    The first and most important value of a suit is its ability to express the wearer's personal style and identity.
                    It's often said that "clothing is a person's second language," and nothing is truer than when a suit or tuxedo becomes a reflection of each individual's personality and style.
                    From choosing colors that reflect a strong personality to selecting a style that demonstrates meticulousness, every detail in a suit is a statement about oneself.
                    This ensures that every gentleman, when wearing a suit, leaves a lasting impression, highlighting their beauty and confidence.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="craft-row reverse">
            <div class="craft-image">
                <img src="/image/abus-hand.png" alt="abus-hand.png">
            </div>
            <div class="craft-content">
                <h5 class="text-uppercase">The Dedication and Meticulousness of a Tailoring Brand</h5>
                <p>
                    The value of a suit is further affirmed by the dedication and meticulousness of a tailoring brand.
                    A suit is not simply an outfit, but also a symbol of each individual's style, reflected in the meticulous and enthusiastic consultation process of our team of consultants. Handcrafted tailors are no exception,
                    devoting their attention to detail to every stitch to create the most perfectly fitting suit for gentlemen.
                    At UNLIM, tailoring is not just a job, but a mission to deliver real value to our customers.
                    With a team of young but experienced consultants, possessing deep knowledge of suits and fashion, combined with a team of skilled and experienced tailors, we are proud to be a tailoring brand that provides gentlemen with the most valuable and high-quality suits.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>
<section class="cta py-5 bg-body-secondary">
    <h4 class="text-dark text-uppercase">Set An appointment</h4>
    <div class="cta-buttons">
        <button class="btn-book">
            <a asp-controller="Appointment" asp-action="Index" class="text-decoration-none text-white">
                BOOK AN APPOINTMENT
            </a>
        </button>
    </div>
</section>
<section class="cta-inf">
    <div class="cta-box text-center">
        <div class="cta-header" onclick="toggleInfo()">
            <span>Want to know more about us. Click here to find out more details!</span>
            <span class="arrow">▼</span>
        </div>

        <div class="cta-content" id="ctaContent">
            <img src="~/image/brand/LOGO-2.png" alt="loggo" style="height:2px;"/>
            <p class="text-center">
                CÔNG TY TNHH MAY MẶC UNLIM VIỆT NAM | GPKD số 0109496957
                Cấp ngày 15/01/2021 tại Sở kế hoạch và đầu tư Thành phố Hà Nội |
                Địa chỉ: Tầng 1, Số 107 Kim Mã, Phường Giảng Võ, Quận Ba Đình, Thành Phố Hà Nội
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
